C or PLC in York County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/york-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, York County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had August to September at 49% of normal and November to December at 54%. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 75% of normal there. Grid 23616 had its driest year in 1965 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
